          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7th",
          "text": "?” In Colorado, there is no exact deadline for going to the hospital after a crash to pursue a personal injury claim, but acting quickly can make a real difference in terms of both your health and your legal claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i7tj",
      "src": "./images/2025-08-shutterstock_2517304591.jpg",
      "alt": "How Long Do you Have to Go to The Hospital After a Car Accident?"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7tl",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7tk",
          "text": "Determining Immediate Medical Needs",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7tn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7tm",
          "text": "Not every injury is immediately noticeable after a collision. That said, some symptoms demand immediate medical attention. These include things like severe bleeding, difficulty breathing, or chest discomfort. In cases like these, there’s no time to hesitate. Emergency care should come first, even before calling your insurance.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7tp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7to",
          "text": "Sometimes adrenaline can reduce your ability to notice pain, making it easy to underestimate the damage. When in doubt, seeing a medical professional ensures you’re not overlooking something serious. The sooner you act, the easier it is to document your condition properly.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7tr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7tq",
          "text": "One important point to remember is that emergency room visits can generate valuable medical records. These records can confirm the extent of your injuries and the timing of your symptoms. That makes them incredibly useful later if you pursue compensation through a personal injury claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7tt",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ts",
          "text": "Urgent Symptoms That Require Immediate Medical Attention",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7tz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7tv",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://medlineplus.gov/ency/article/001927.htm"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7tu",
          "text": "According to",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7tw",
          "text": " MedlinePlus",
          "marks": [
            "l7tv"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ty",
          "text": ", some signs you should not ignore can include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7u1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7u0",
          "text": "Uncontrollable bleeding",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7u3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7u2",
          "text": "Shortness of breath or trouble breathing",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7u5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7u4",
          "text": "Confusion or loss of consciousness",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7u7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7u6",
          "text": "Severe chest pain or discomfort lasting over two minutes",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7u9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7u8",
          "text": "Vomiting blood or coughing up blood",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7ub",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ua",
          "text": "Head or spinal injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7ud",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7uc",
          "text": "Sudden, severe pain in any area",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ue",
          "text": "Swelling in the face, eyes, or tongue",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ug",
          "text": "These symptoms can indicate life-threatening conditions. Quick action might save your life and give your legal claim the medical proof it needs to move forward.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uj",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ui",
          "text": "How to Identify Injuries That Appear Later",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uo",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7ul",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/whiplash-injury-compensation-how-much-you-could-receive/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7uk",
          "text": "Crash-related injuries aren’t always obvious in the hours after a collision. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7um",
          "text": "Whiplash",
          "marks": [
            "l7ul"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7un",
          "text": ", concussions, and soft tissue injuries might take days to reveal themselves. Even if you initially feel fine, visiting a healthcare provider is still smart. A thorough exam can help identify injuries that may not be immediately apparent and prevent complications from delayed treatment.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7up",
          "text": "Symptoms like headaches, stiffness, nausea, or dizziness can develop gradually after a crash. Medical records that show a close timeline between your accident and your symptoms help establish a strong claim. Delaying care might create gaps that insurers could use to question the connection between the injury and the incident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ur",
          "text": "That’s one reason why people often ask, “",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7us",
          "text": "how long do you have to go to the hospital after a car accident?”",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ut",
          "text": " While there isn’t a fixed legal time limit, your health and your legal rights are both better protected when treatment happens promptly.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uw",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7uv",
          "text": "How Early Intervention Affects Legal Outcomes",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7uy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ux",
          "text": "Getting treatment quickly supports more than just your recovery. It helps prove that your injuries were caused by the accident, not something else. The timing of your first medical visit often plays a big role in personal injury claims.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7v0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7uz",
          "text": "In court or negotiations, your medical timeline can help demonstrate how the crash affected your life. Doctors’ notes, diagnostic tests, and prescribed treatments form the foundation of a well-supported legal claim. Waiting too long may allow the opposing party to argue that the injury wasn’t serious or even related.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7v2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7v1",
          "text": "Also, early care can help clarify whether any injuries existed before the crash. Medical providers will record what symptoms you report, and the diagnosis may make it easier to show that those injuries were not present before the crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7v4",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7v3",
          "text": "Understanding Colorado’s Statute of Limitations for Auto Accident Claims",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7v6",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://colorado.public.law/statutes/crs_13-80-101"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7v5",
          "text": "Timing matters in legal cases, too. According to the",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7v7",
          "text": " Colorado Revised Statutes §13-80-101",
          "marks": [
            "l7v6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7v8",
          "text": ", you generally have ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7v9",
          "text": "three years",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7va",
          "text": " from the date of a car accident to file a lawsuit.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vc",
          "text": "Although this may seem like plenty of time, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vd",
          "text": "filing sooner is often better",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ve",
          "text": ". Waiting until the last minute can make it harder to gather evidence, secure witness statements, or verify medical records.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vg",
          "text": "It’s also worth mentioning that insurers have their own reporting deadlines. Delaying your hospital visit may complicate the claims process. This leads many people to ask again, “",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vh",
          "text": "how long do you have to go to the hospital after a car accident”",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vi",
          "text": " in Colorado. Acting quickly ensures no deadlines are missed and no opportunities lost.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vl",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vk",
          "text": "What Is the Importance of Documentation",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vm",
          "text": "Medical documentation is the backbone of most successful injury claims. Seeing a doctor promptly creates a clear record of your injuries and connects them directly to the crash. These records validate your symptoms, treatment plan, and recovery timeline.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vo",
          "text": "They also act as a safeguard if your condition worsens or new symptoms develop. Insurance companies, adjusters, and even jurors often seek a consistent story backed by credible documents. Skipping this step or delaying care puts your credibility at risk.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vr",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vq",
          "text": "What Are the Risks of Delay?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vs",
          "text": "Delaying medical care can cause more harm than just physical discomfort. It gives insurance companies the opportunity to argue that your injuries weren’t caused by the accident. They might suggest your condition came from another source or wasn’t serious enough to need immediate care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vu",
          "text": "Even though Colorado gives you three years to file, your case may weaken with each passing day you wait to seek treatment. Acting promptly to consult a doctor can strengthen your case, both for your recovery and your ability to build a solid legal foundation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vx",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vw",
          "text": "What Are Insurance Implications",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7vz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7vy",
          "text": "Insurance companies tend to question delays in treatment, particularly when the reported injuries are not immediately documented. They may reduce your compensation or deny the claim altogether by arguing that your symptoms are the result of unrelated causes.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7w1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7w0",
          "text": "The longer the gap between the accident and your first medical visit, the harder it becomes to show a direct link. On the other hand, quick action can lead to a smoother claims process and fairer settlement discussions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7w3",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7w2",
          "text": "Still Wondering How Long Do You Have to Go to the Hospital After a Car Accident?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
